{"availability":"available","full":"talhashady/stock-holmes","name":"stock-holmes","description":"Real-time XAUUSD 5-minute-ahead price direction predictor using LightGBM, Twelve Data API, and Streamlit","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-14T12:29:28Z","updated":"2026-10-08T06:36:01Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://stockholmes.streamlit.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://stockholmes.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T06:40:01.677Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T06:40:01.677Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T06:40:01.677Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:25.010Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:11:19.134Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:42:31.919Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:40:01.677Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A time-series intelligence system that predicts Gold spot price direction (UP/DOWN/FLAT) 5 minutes into the future using machine learning, built with python, LightGBM, and the Twelve Data API (which gave a 70% correct prediction rate during testing).","Stock Holmes is a predictive system designed to capture short-horizon inefficiencies in the Gold spot market (XAU/USD), with forecasts viewable in real-time on the live dashboard. Rather than attempting to regress exact future prices (which is heavily dominated by noise at short timeframes), this system reframes the target into a 3-way classification problem:","Disclaimer: In line with the random-walk hypothesis, predicting short-term asset movements is extremely difficult. This model aims to extract a minor directional statistical edge over a naive baseline, not guarantee trade profitability (although while testing this it gave a 70% correct prediction rate)."],"features":["📈 UP: Price change > +0.01% (+10 bps)","📉 DOWN: Price change < -0.01% (-10 bps)","➡️ FLAT: Price change within ±0.01%","🕵️‍♂️ \"The Case File Terminal\" UI Theme: A unique detective investigation board aesthetic. Price predictions become \"leads,\" resolved cases are \"closed cases,\" and signal confidence is gauged via an SVG certainty…","🔮 Real-Time Classification: Forecasts Gold price direction 5 minutes into the future along with exact signal confidence weights (giving a 70% correct prediction rate during testing)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/talhashady/stock-holmes/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"dc07c3e55c15a5e3c5c380ad8e56a323736ebf40cc5cf27efcc91372f8989f4e","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:25.123Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T06:40:01.773Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A time-series intelligence system that predicts Gold spot price direction (UP/DOWN/FLAT) 5 minutes into the future using machine learning, built with python, LightGBM, and the Twelve Data API (which gave a 70% correct prediction rate during testing).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/talhashady/stock-holmes/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Visitors must enter their own Twelve Data API Key to execute manual runs, preventing rate-limiting exhaustion of the shared API key quota.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/talhashady/stock-holmes/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"dc07c3e55c15a5e3c5c380ad8e56a323736ebf40cc5cf27efcc91372f8989f4e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/talhashady/stock-holmes/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T06:40:01.773Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T06:36:01Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/talhashady/stock-holmes/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T06:40:01.775Z","hash":"dc07c3e55c15a5e3c5c380ad8e56a323736ebf40cc5cf27efcc91372f8989f4e","originalBytes":12386,"storedBytes":12386,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","live","api","holmes","prediction","stock","dashboard","lightgbm","model","price","twelve","barrier","primary","stre